{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/875178-legacy-packs","id":875178,"title":"Legacy Packs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-26T20:11:02-07:00","id":875178,"title":"Legacy Packs","content":"In your setting, do you have packs that outlasted all the original members, or do you just assume that the old werewolves don't allow new blood into their groups (or the spirit doesn't want to be tied to the same group beyond the lifespans of the original pact-makers)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2203-corrigan","name":"Corrigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T20:24:24-07:00","id":875195,"title":"","content":"Yes, but they tend to be bloodline-oriented. They basically started as a family and, long after, have still only had descendants in the pack. For the most part.<br /> <br /> There was a powerful spirit that to fulfill its identity sort of required a pack of werewolves. The totem, there, was basically the linchpin of it.<br /> <br /> I like the idea from<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seven_Soldiers\" target=\"_blank\"> Seven Soldiers</a>. A special pack that forms every once and awhile due to a great need for them. Perhaps pulled together by Luna or some atavistic part of them that hears Father Wolf. Though I've never done it myself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avata